    [
     1,
     "<div>Hello, </div><div>I tried to use the following codes to fit a two-dimensional GPCM model to a dataset with n = 658. And them use function &quot;summary()&quot; to get factor loadings. The codes ran smoothly, and provided the factor correlation, which is = .442 (the outputs are also posted below). I wonder why this factor correlation (.442) provided in R does not equal to the correlation between the two Theta&#39;s. The correlation between the two Thetas estimated from the mirt() function is around .74. Thank you</div><div><br></div><div>&gt; mod2 = mirt(input, 2, itemtype = &quot;gpcm&quot;, SE=TRUE, verbose=FALSE)  <br></div><div>&gt; loading=summary(mod2)<br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Rotation:  oblimin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\">Rotated factor loadings:</span><br></p></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"></span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"> </span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">      F1       F2    h2</span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">V1  0.01439  0.4433 0.202</span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">V2 -0.00628  0.5238 0.271</span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">V3 -0.05760  0.6958 0.452</span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">V4  0.23699  0.3627 0.264</span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;borde